  "problem": "$\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061(-3)=$",
  "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061(-3) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}-{e}^{-(-3)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}-{e}^{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
